<title>UK: JFS sets 350 million mark three-year bond.</title>
<headline>JFS sets 350 million mark three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JAPAN FINANCE CORP FOR SMALL BUSINESS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  JAPAN (RATED AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    30.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.4625  PAY DATE    30.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.65	REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.3125    LIST FEE    0.15</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT SEPTEMBER 1999 BOBL 112 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
